M R 0~
silvery minotaur~
a silvery minotaur~
A silver streak of horns and bloodlust thunders in your direction.
~
&01&00   Sharp &02green&00 eyes follow your every move. They belong to a beast
covered in a silver-gray fur.  This minotaurs thighs are thick and
resemble those of a horse. His muscled torso is broad and chiseled
not unlike that of a man.  Both are covered on long wavy hair of a
silvery color.  Short wavy hair covers his human-like arms. Silver
hair also covers animal-like lower legs.  Silvery flesh covers his
thick short fingers. With a steer's head and razor sharp horns, he
is a prime example of one of the fearsome and legendary minotaurs.
~
