M D 0~
black minotaur~
a black minotaur~
Crimson eyes and black horns hunt for another unlucky victim here.
~
&01&00   Soulless &08crimson&00 eyes stare into you. They belong to a minotaur
that is covered from head to toe in curly jet-black fur.  Upon her
strong thighs and wide torso, the hair is longer and the curls are
loose.  Shorter, tighter curls cover her arms and lower legs.  Her
head resembles a rams, with a pair of foot long horns that end in
points. Small tusks protrude from her grin. She has deer-like legs
that end in hooves and humanoid arms and hands that grasp for you.
~
