M W 0~
bull god lord labyrinth minotaur~
the Lord of the Labyrinth~
The Lord of the Labyrinth is going to kill you now!
~
   Steely death stares at you from unthinking bestial eyes.  He is
a huge minotaur that towers nine feet tall.  His thighs are larger
than a Clydesdale horse's and his hooves are just as intimidating.
Herculean in girth, his arms are five feet long ending in enormous
hands.  From the top of his frightful bestial head two giant horns
emerge. They start out protruding outwards and then curve forward.
Their total length is at least five feet each. His face is equally
large, as is his snout.  Centered in that snout, is a large silver
ring. It's not polished and glows from within with a silver light.
~
